{
  "description": "core §8.6, a catalog's id. Written by hand from the text, checked, never blessed. Each case is an accepted catalog's `text` → `expect`: `jcs`, the RFC 8785 serialization of the document read; `sha256`, the hex sha256 of those bytes; and `id`, their first 4 bytes as 8 lowercase hex digits. Spacing, member order and a string's escapes do not move the id, since JCS reads the document and not its text.",
